# V2X-MEC Offloading Project Skills

## Project Overview
This project implements PAPO (Predictive And Phase-aligned Online Offloading) for V2X cooperative perception tasks.

**Current Status**: 85% complete (DRL baselines + experiment framework done)

## Quick Commands

### Run Simulation
```bash
# Quick test (5 seconds)
python3 main.py --mode quick --duration 5

# Standard simulation (100 seconds)
python3 main.py --mode standard

# Full experiment with multiple runs
python3 main.py --mode full --num-runs 10
```

### Run All Experiments (One-Click)
```bash
# Use shell script (recommended)
./scripts/run_all_experiments.sh 5 30

# Or Python directly
python3 -m simulation.experiments.run_all_experiments --seeds 5 --duration 30

# Resume from checkpoint
python3 -m simulation.experiments.run_all_experiments --seeds 5 --duration 30 --resume
```

### Run Unified Comparison (PAPO vs DRL)
```bash
python3 -m simulation.experiments.compare_all --seeds 3 --duration 30 --drl-episodes 200
```

### DRL Training (with Checkpoint Support)
```bash
# Train DQN and PPO baselines
python3 -m simulation.baselines.train_drl --episodes 500

# Resume training from checkpoint
python3 -m simulation.baselines.train_drl --episodes 500 --resume

# Background training (long runs)
./scripts/run_long_training.sh 1000 both

# Plot training curves
python3 -m simulation.baselines.train_drl --plot
```

### Generate Figures and Tables
```bash
# Generate paper figures from results
python3 -m simulation.experiments.visualize_results --latex

# Output: figures/*.pdf, figures/table*.tex
```

### Module Testing
```bash
# Test core modules
python3 -m simulation.core.task
python3 -m simulation.core.vehicle
python3 -m simulation.core.rsu

# Test algorithms
python3 -m simulation.algorithms.cpa
python3 -m simulation.algorithms.dpa
python3 -m simulation.algorithms.lyapunov

# Test DRL baselines
python3 -m simulation.baselines.dqn_offload
python3 -m simulation.baselines.ppo_offload
python3 -m simulation.baselines.gym_env
```

